sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Browser or CLI
    participant Upload as Upload API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S3
    participant Queue as SQS
    participant Worker as Stage worker

    User->>Client: Select files and enter metadata
    Client->>Upload: Register batch and files
    Upload->>DB: Create idempotent upload records
    Upload-->>Client: File IDs and upload settings

    loop Small batches of parts
        Client->>Upload: Request presigned URLs
        Upload->>S3: Create or inspect multipart upload
        Upload-->>Client: Presigned part URLs
        Client->>S3: Upload parts directly
        Client->>Upload: Report aggregated progress
    end

    Upload->>S3: Complete multipart upload
    S3-->>Queue: Object-created event

    loop Processing stages
        Queue->>Worker: Deliver stage job
        Worker->>S3: Read original or prior derivative
        Worker->>S3: Write derivative
        Worker->>DB: Store output and stage status
        Worker->>Queue: Enqueue next stage
    end

    Worker->>DB: Mark file ready or partially enriched
    Client->>Upload: Resume request after interruption
    Upload->>S3: List persisted parts
    Upload-->>Client: Return only missing parts
